<node id="Dr. Martens AU">
  <data key="d0">Dr. Martens AU</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Dr. Martens AU is the official e-commerce storefront for the Dr. Martens brand operating in Australia. It functions as the Australian division of Dr. Martens, incorporating brand-specific configurations such as the use of dual `&lt;h1&gt;` elements on product detail pages (PDPs). This storefront shares technical implementations with other Global Retail Architecture (GRA) platforms, including backend integration with the Fredhopper system, where it uses a specific category code labeled 'catalog01_40001' to manage product categorization.

The Dr. Martens AU site is built with modern web technologies, utilizing styled-components with hashed class names for styling and incorporating gallery images identified through alt attributes to ensure accessibility and improved content organization. The storefront’s staging environment is hosted under the URL stag-drmartens-au.accentgra.com and is supported by the API project code drm-au.

This Australian e-commerce site earns Qantas Points for its customers, linking into broader loyalty programs to enhance customer retention and engagement. However, the storefront has experienced technical issues, particularly related to product listing pages (PLPs). One noted problem involves grid timeouts impacting the `waitForProductGrid` process, which has affected testing workflows. Additionally, there is an ongoing investigation into a specific issue where the method `getTotalProductCount()` returns zero on PLPs, resulting in test failures and potentially impacting the accuracy and completeness of product displays.

Overall, Dr. Martens AU combines brand-specific e-commerce functionalities with a robust technical infrastructure consistent with other GRA storefronts, while addressing challenges related to product listing reliability and performance.&lt;SEP&gt;An Australian storefront previously believed to have a shipping-address field-pattern mismatch.&lt;SEP&gt;A storefront brand on the AU staging environment used to verify genuine automatic prefill of checkout address and where the Region/State combobox selector was confirmed live.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-18c320b704b53c1b59c41f904f29e640-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf017a813cd0b782aef34bc894b9789d-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf017a813cd0b782aef34bc894b9789d-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-89278d88eec2b6ee50a522529e8ddbde-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-000</data>
