  <data key="d0">Skechers</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Skechers is one of the brands supported by the GRA integration using Adobe Campaign for email marketing.&lt;SEP&gt;Skechers refers to the global brand name encompassing Skechers AU and Skechers NZ.&lt;SEP&gt;A global footwear and lifestyle brand mentioned in the context of testing web elements.&lt;SEP&gt;An ecommerce footwear storefront with women's PLP first products lacking size selectors requiring navigation via the men's PLP.&lt;SEP&gt;A footwear brand requiring entry to MENS PLP for PDP tests with size selector.</data>
