<node id="Vans NZ">
  <data key="d0">Vans NZ</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Vans NZ is an ecommerce storefront operating in New Zealand that offers Vans branded products through an online platform. It functions as a specific Global Retail Architecture (GRA) storefront, technically mirroring the configuration and functionality of Vans AU, including elements such as the Bloomreach acquisition popup. This storefront is distinguished by particular regional preferences, such as gendered navigation configurations, which tailor the user experience according to local customer expectations.

The Vans New Zealand storefront has undergone recent modifications, including the removal of pdpSizeToggleLabels, which affects size selection displays on product detail pages. Some technical issues have been identified, such as forced swatch clicks failing due to React router interception, which impacts the interaction with product color options. Additionally, the process of selecting regional or state location via a combobox selector remains unconfirmed or unavailable, leading to the skipping of certain tests related to this feature.

As part of its structure, Vans NZ requires users to navigate to the men's product listing page (PLP) to access product detail pages (PDP) for testing features such as the size selector. Despite resembling its Australian counterpart in many technical aspects, Vans NZ does not earn Qantas Points and currently has no associated API project code. The staging URL for this storefront is stag-vans-nz.accentgra.com. Overall, Vans NZ represents the localized digital presence of the Vans brand in New Zealand, adapted for regional user preferences and operational nuances.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-18c320b704b53c1b59c41f904f29e640-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d0bad7be8975f725cb7551dbf9673c25-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">ecommerce-storefronts.md&lt;SEP&gt;gra-storefront-tech-notes.md&lt;SEP&gt;pdp-004-005-vans-au-root-cause.md&lt;SEP&gt;ecommerce-pdp-page-gotchas.md&lt;SEP&gt;e2e-chkout-009-checkout-address-prefill.md</data>
