<node id="Dr. Martens NZ">
  <data key="d0">Dr. Martens NZ</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Dr. Martens NZ is an ecommerce storefront specifically serving the New Zealand market, dedicated to selling Dr. Martens branded products. This storefront operates with technical and configuration similarities to its Australian counterpart, indicating a shared framework and design approach between the two regional sites. The platform is hosted with a staging URL at stag-drmartens-nz.accentgra.com and does not utilize an associated API project code. Additionally, purchases made through this storefront do not earn Qantas Points.

The New Zealand Dr. Martens storefront experiences several technical and interface issues. Notably, the swatch scan loop used for product display takes approximately 15 to 20 seconds per product, suggesting potential performance latency. Furthermore, product detail pages render two h1 HTML elements, which violates strict web development mode conventions and could affect accessibility or SEO compliance. A significant layout problem has been reported involving the L3L4Navigation container, which blocks the size selection button when viewed at a resolution of 1920×1080, impairing user interface functionality for size selection.

Another notable concern is related to the Region/State combobox selector on the storefront. This selector is either unconfirmed or not detected during testing, leading to a skip in this portion of the testing process. This issue may impact region-specific functionalities or local user experience, reflecting incomplete or problematic regional interface elements within the storefront.

Overall, Dr. Martens NZ presents as a region-specific digital retail platform closely aligned in structure to its Australian equivalent but marked by several front-end performance and usability challenges that affect product display, navigation, and regional interface components.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-18c320b704b53c1b59c41f904f29e640-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-001</data>
