  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A browser automation tool used for running tests in an environment that behaves like a real browser.&lt;SEP&gt;A testing framework used for simulating and debugging interaction flows in web applications.&lt;SEP&gt;A software testing framework referenced in version notes indicating an upgrade from 1.61.0 to 1.61.1 to resolve a specific TypeError under Node.js v22.18.0.&lt;SEP&gt;A testing framework that uses coordinate-based synthetic clicks with `force:true` in this context.&lt;SEP&gt;A testing framework that retries failed tests and re-runs beforeAll hooks but not earlier tests.</data>
