<node id="Bloomreach Popup">
  <data key="d0">Bloomreach Popup</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">Popup rendering a label "Womens" but not a button, thus not affecting the failure.&lt;SEP&gt;A popup that may intermittently intercept the clickCartIcon() action in Vans AU test scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;A popup that can block automation actions such as clickCartIcon() on Vans AU storefront.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-d0bad7be8975f725cb7551dbf9673c25-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b925bb86b9a77a3986020e5efd7b2e99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-001</data>
  <data key="d4">pdp-004-005-vans-au-root-cause.md&lt;SEP&gt;project_context.md&lt;SEP&gt;ecommerce-pdp-page-gotchas.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1783085982</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Bloomreach Popup</data>
</node>
<node id="Vans AU">
  <data key="d0">Vans AU</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">Vans AU is an ecommerce storefront representing the Vans brand specifically for the Australian market. It operates as a distinct online retail environment designed to sell Vans-branded items in Australia and is technically aligned with other Global Retail Architecture (GRA) platforms. The storefront supports an API project code named van-au and maintains a staging URL at stag-vans-au.accentgra.com. Customers shopping on Vans AU have the opportunity to earn Qantas Points through their purchases.

The Vans AU storefront incorporates a Bloomreach-managed acquisition popup that appears as an overlay on the homepage and other user interface elements. This popup has been noted to potentially block user interactions, including those within authentication modals and on product swatch selections, thereby impacting user experience. The acquisition popup is a key feature but also a source of intermittent issues, such as flakiness in overlay detection and occasional test failures during ecommerce testing and root cause analysis.

In terms of user interface, Vans AU features navigation elements such as a dropdown-triggered CLOTHING menu, which is part of the site’s distinctive functionality. Despite its functional alignment with other international GRA storefronts, this Australian environment exhibits complexities in handling the popup overlay, leading to challenges in test stability and user interaction blocking.

Overall, Vans AU represents the dedicated Australian ecommerce presence for the Vans brand, combining standard global technical frameworks with localized features and promotional integrations like Qantas Points, while also facing specific technical challenges related to the Bloomreach acquisition popup affecting usability and testing outcomes.&lt;SEP&gt;A storefront brand that passed all soft asserts in the checkout address prefill test.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-18c320b704b53c1b59c41f904f29e640-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-d0bad7be8975f725cb7551dbf9673c25-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-b925bb86b9a77a3986020e5efd7b2e99-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cecb0d91ce73637998acce9c5c61beac-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-000</data>
  <data key="d4">ecommerce-storefronts.md&lt;SEP&gt;gra-storefront-tech-notes.md&lt;SEP&gt;pdp-004-005-vans-au-root-cause.md&lt;SEP&gt;project_context.md&lt;SEP&gt;ecommerce-pdp-page-gotchas.md&lt;SEP&gt;e2e-chkout-009-checkout-address-prefill.md</data>
  <data key="d5">1785682490</data>
  <data key="d6"></data>
  <data key="d7">Vans AU</data>
</node>
