<node id="Platypus NZ">
  <data key="d0">Platypus NZ</data>
  <data key="d1">other</data>
  <data key="d2">An ecommerce storefront in New Zealand selling Platypus branded items, with staging URL stag-platypus-nz.accentgra.com and no associated API project code. Does not earn Qantas Points.&lt;SEP&gt;Platypus NZ is an online storefront listed in the DataLayer, with details like the division "platypus" and the currency "NZD."&lt;SEP&gt;A specific GRA storefront based in New Zealand with the same technical setup as Platypus AU.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Zealand branch of Platypus with similar configurations to Platypus AU but different currency support.&lt;SEP&gt;Ecommerce storefront site located in New Zealand, included in localization test E2E-LOC-002.&lt;SEP&gt;A storefront brand on the NZ staging environment, explicitly excluded from the storefront loop due to internal server errors from the createCustomer GraphQL mutation.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-18c320b704b53c1b59c41f904f29e640-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-cf017a813cd0b782aef34bc894b9789d-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-a10959480a72a6acd62582bf626094f7-chunk-000</data>
