<node id="Braintree">
  <data key="d0">Braintree</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A payment gateway that facilitates transactions via methods such as credit cards, PayPal, and PayPal Pay-in-4.&lt;SEP&gt;Braintree is a payment service integrated into the GRA architecture and supported by Forter's fraud detection system.&lt;SEP&gt;A payment variant requiring a payment_method_nonce field during payment method setting, includes variants like applepay and paypal.&lt;SEP&gt;A payment method variant for credit card that can be minted purely via API calls without needing an SDK or browser.&lt;SEP&gt;A payment service provider whose sandbox credit-card payment methods are tested via API calls without requiring a browser or SDK.&lt;SEP&gt;Payment gateway integrated with PayPal in the checkout flow, using sandbox and live environments for verification.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-608145bb261a9d22b7e671804cd417ae-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-608145bb261a9d22b7e671804cd417ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-13c6ca4c338ad773242cc059a8049dc9-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-13c6ca4c338ad773242cc059a8049dc9-chunk-003&lt;SEP&gt;doc-22b4f6a856aea6d7be1c0b7f9d72afb6-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-22b4f6a856aea6d7be1c0b7f9d72afb6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-ddca318d24811cc5b8909ad5fe282759-chunk-000</data>
