<node id="Magento">
  <data key="d0">Magento</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">An e-commerce platform comprising frontend (FE) and backend (BE) components used for integrations, product management, and other ecommerce features.&lt;SEP&gt;Magento, part of Adobe Commerce, is the front-end e-commerce platform for the GRA system.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform used server-side to manage the guest cart GUID and associated session cookies.&lt;SEP&gt;The e-commerce platform whose variants of add-to-cart GraphQL mutations are referenced as matched by the pattern including addConfigurableProductsToCart.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-608145bb261a9d22b7e671804cd417ae-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-608145bb261a9d22b7e671804cd417ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-6a6e1efbd4304c8a3c59149f2dcf1317-chunk-000</data>
