<node id="Forter">
  <data key="d0">Forter</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A fraud detection service that works in conjunction with Braintree payment methods to ensure the security of online transactions.&lt;SEP&gt;Forter is a fraud detection system integrated into the GRA architecture that evaluates orders created using payment methods like credit cards or Braintree.&lt;SEP&gt;A third-party service integrated into all 8 storefronts for maintaining session-related cart storage.&lt;SEP&gt;A third-party fraud prevention service utilized by brands like Platypus, Skechers, Vans, and Dr. Martens.&lt;SEP&gt;A company or system that provides fraud detection tokens stored in localStorage, triggering a request to cdn0.forter.com.&lt;SEP&gt;An asynchronous fraud check service involved in the original recommendation to avoid coupling order placement tests to it.&lt;SEP&gt;An entity in the downstream flow triggered by placed orders (real or test).</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-608145bb261a9d22b7e671804cd417ae-chunk-002&lt;SEP&gt;doc-608145bb261a9d22b7e671804cd417ae-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-22b4f6a856aea6d7be1c0b7f9d72afb6-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-22b4f6a856aea6d7be1c0b7f9d72afb6-chunk-000</data>
