  <data key="d1">content</data>
  <data key="d2">A deep technical investigation covering 8 GRA storefronts, analyzing frameworks, DOM, network interactions, cart implementations, third-party integrations, and automation issues.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000</data>
