  <data key="d0">Magento PWA Studio</data>
  <data key="d1">artifact</data>
  <data key="d2">A front-end development framework for Magento, identified as being used by all 8 GRA storefronts, operating through Peregrine/Venia components.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000</data>
