</node>
<node id="FullStory">
  <data key="d0">FullStory</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A third-party analytics service observed in the GRA storefronts' network interactions.&lt;SEP&gt;A session recording service utilized by Platypus but not observed for Skechers, Vans, or Dr. Martens.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform for session recording that captures user interactions on websites such as Platypus AU.&lt;SEP&gt;A platform used for session recording, which is blocked to optimize performance.&lt;SEP&gt;An external service blocked during GRA integration tests.</data>
  <data key="d3">doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-000&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-005&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-001&lt;SEP&gt;doc-c9488069466f7da02e04d0a79614e167-chunk-004&lt;SEP&gt;doc-676423a7c776b523c259115b15e81a0c-chunk-000</data>
